'''Ganso!! Nyanko Daisensou''' (元祖!!にゃんこ大戦争, '''Original!! Nyanko Great War''') was a subscription-based tower defense game available on older generations of mobile phones. Developed by [[PONOS Corporation|PONOS]] and released in 2010. In July 2011 it received a sequel, [[Kumanchu Royale]], and in 2012 it was [[Nyanko Daisensou|re-released]] with more content. It was originally named Nyanko Daisensou (にゃんこ大戦争, "Nyanko Great War"), but later had "Ganso!!" (元祖!!, "Original!!") added in order to distinguish it from the re-release. It was discontinued on January 6th, 2015 alongside Kumanchu Royale.

