==How to play==
===OpenDoja===
:''Note: This method only works for PC/Desktop systems.''
#Download and install Java from [https://www.java.com/en/download/manual.jsp the official website]. Java must be version 22 or above for OpenDoja to run.
#Download the most up to date version of [https://github.com/GrenderG/openDoJa/releases/download/nightly/opendoja-nightly.jar Nightly] as well as the latest stable version of [https://github.com/GrenderG/openDoJa/releases/latest OpenDoja].
#Download the Ganso!! Nyanko Daisensou files from [https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fo/ki9p9ejk02v3p9ka6cyrs/AHm9UJIor4p92jggbpRgIXY?rlkey=obmrjzewhk8lrlwntisvxeeuo&st=gpxrcral&e=1&dl=0 here].
#In the address bar where the Ganso!! Nyanko Daisensou and OpenDoja files are, input this command "java -jar opendoja-release.jar".
##Alternatively, to skip step 5, input the command "java -jar opendoja-release.jar --run-jam THE_Battle_Cats_fixed.jam"
#Drag the Ganso!! Nyanko Daisensou.jam file into the new window that pops up.
##This step is skipped if you did step just below step 4.
#Now you will be playing Ganso!! Nyanko Daisensou, if the screen is too small, right-click and select the size comfortable for you.

===Keitai World Launcher===
#Download and install [https://keitaiarchive.org/ Keitai World Launcher].
#Select "Appli" option.
#Search "THE Battle Cats".
#Download the game.
#Now you will be playing Ganso!! Nyanko Daisensou, if the screen is too small, right click and select the size comfortable for you.

